article.sections.7.blocks.5.text:
```cypher
MATCH (hit:Chunk {id: 'paragraph-17'})
OPTIONAL MATCH (hit)-[:PART_OF*1..3]->(ancestor)
RETURN hit.id AS chunkId,
       hit.text AS retrievedText,
       collect(DISTINCT {
         id: ancestor.id,
         text: ancestor.text
       }) AS surroundingContext;
```
